# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we run Estimator. We would like to focus on the role of ZNE, and so we might want to set `resilience_level = 0` to avoid conflating effects of twirling with the effect of ZNE. However, we also want to compare our \"by-hand\" ZNE to the ZNE settings built into Qiskit, which include twirling. We thus set `resilience_level = 1` here. Setting `resilience_level = 2` invokes the Qiskit ZNE settings, which we will use shortly.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang kita jalankan Estimator. Kita ingin fokus pada peran ZNE, jadi mungkin kita ingin mengatur `resilience_level = 0` supaya efek twirling tidak bercampur dengan efek ZNE. Namun, kita juga ingin membandingkan ZNE \"manual\" kita dengan pengaturan ZNE bawaan Qiskit, yang menyertakan twirling. Jadi di sini kita atur `resilience_level = 1`. Mengatur `resilience_level = 2` akan memanggil pengaturan ZNE Qiskit, yang akan kita pakai sebentar lagi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we print out the noise levels and expectation values.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang kita cetak tingkat noise dan nilai ekspektasinya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is the part where we are being the most cavalier: we do a linear fit to these data without any attention being paid to the variance of each value we obtained, and without trying to theoretically predict whether the fit needs to be linear. Again, the built-in ZNE does a much better job than what we're doing by hand.\n"
msgstr "Ini bagian di mana kita paling ceroboh: kita melakukan fit linear pada data ini tanpa memperhatikan varians tiap nilai yang kita peroleh, dan tanpa mencoba memprediksi secara teoretis apakah fit-nya perlu linear. Sekali lagi, ZNE bawaan bekerja jauh lebih baik daripada yang kita lakukan secara manual.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We go ahead and plot this prior to interpretation.\n"
msgstr "Kita langsung buat plot-nya sebelum diinterpretasikan.\n"

